OL,5,G1300 Classical Live
OL,6,     FLinton Stephens introduces
OL,7,     Fhighlights from the Proms,
OL,8,     Fincluding music by Beethoven &
OL,9,     FHaydn, plus brass music from the
OL,10,     FEdinburgh International Festival
OL,11,     Fand choral music from Prague.
OL,12,G1600 Composer of the Week: Mendelssohn
OL,13,     F1/5. Kate Molleson follows
OL,14,     FMendelssohn's early journeys, from
OL,15,     FBerlin salons to Alpine
OL,16,     Fadventures.
OL,17,G1700 In Tune
OL,18,     FClare Hammond plays live and is
OL,19,     Fjoined by George Vass, ahead of
OL,20,     Fthe Presteigne Festival. Conductor
OL,21,     FCristian Macelaru on his BBC Prom.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
